          "level": "High",
          "note": "The firm is directly enmeshed in U.S. crypto regulatory battles—backing the Clarity Act and GENIUS Act principles—meaning adverse legislative outcomes would impair both its lobbying credibility and the value of its U.S.-focused portfolio.",
