        {
          "dimension": "Centralization / governance capture",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Concentrated token positions across EigenLayer, Optimism, LayerZero, and Uniswap give a16z outsized voting power in protocols that market themselves as decentralized, creating systemic governance risk if the firm's interests diverge from token holders.",
